(3493382, 488385, 52439, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, with the horizon being in the upper third i think the shot deserves more foreground interest though, otherwise you might have been better placing the horizon in the lower third to conentrate more on the mountain tops and the sky.</td>', 'Nice shot, with the horizon being in the upper third i think the shot deserves more foreground interest though, otherwise you might have been better placing the horizon in the lower third to conentrate more on the mountain tops and the sky.', '2007-03-28 08:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
