(3493394, 486985, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow, stunning shot.<br/>It really grabs you. I like the centered composition in this case, as the clouds seem to naturally vignette the end end of it, where the delicate silhouttes are hiding. I might possibly have been tempted to clone out the wooden pole to the far right but it''s not important.</td>', 'Wow, stunning shot.It really grabs you. I like the centered composition in this case, as the clouds seem to naturally vignette the end end of it, where the delicate silhouttes are hiding. I might possibly have been tempted to clone out the wooden pole to the far right but it''s not important.', '2007-03-28 08:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3493398, 489413, 52439, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Nice use of flash here to sutbly light her face. I like her hair being blown everywhere as it seems she doesn''t care.</td>', 'Nice shot. Nice use of flash here to sutbly light her face. I like her hair being blown everywhere as it seems she doesn''t care.', '2007-03-28 08:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3493401, 489506, 52439, '<td valign="top">That is just so surreal if it''s unedited.</td>', 'That is just so surreal if it''s unedited.', '2007-03-28 08:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3493410, 488352, 52439, '<td valign="top">Pretty poor concept, but fairly well executed if i''m honest. It looks overprocessed. I don''t really understand it either, i get the ''still''/''steel''.</td>', 'Pretty poor concept, but fairly well executed if i''m honest. It looks overprocessed. I don''t really understand it either, i get the ''still''/''steel''.', '2007-03-28 08:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3493414, 488255, 52439, '<td valign="top">I think it would be more emotive if the viewer could recognise the person abit more, with a clearer sillhouette or her face showing.</td>', 'I think it would be more emotive if the viewer could recognise the person abit more, with a clearer sillhouette or her face showing.', '2007-03-28 08:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3493416, 489135, 68346, '<td valign="top">you should have fixed the horizon. nice image though</td>', 'you should have fixed the horizon. nice image though', '2007-03-28 08:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
