(3493427, 488057, 52439, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this will do so well, however i love it.<br/>Plain and simple, only thing i''d suggest would be to desaturate the branches in the foreground, but obviously you can''t do that in basic editing.<br/>8</td>', 'I don''t think this will do so well, however i love it.Plain and simple, only thing i''d suggest would be to desaturate the branches in the foreground, but obviously you can''t do that in basic editing.8', '2007-03-28 08:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3493429, 489176, 52439, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.</td>', 'Brilliant.', '2007-03-28 08:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3493431, 487608, 52439, '<td valign="top">Wow, i love this. Takes a while to try and see all the bits, but it''s very well done, love the slanted perspective here.</td>', 'Wow, i love this. Takes a while to try and see all the bits, but it''s very well done, love the slanted perspective here.', '2007-03-28 08:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
