(3496911, 487248, 76153, '<td valign="top">I really like the dynamic color; it might have benefitted from a wider crop or usage of the rule of thirds. Spectacular photo, though!</td>', 'I really like the dynamic color; it might have benefitted from a wider crop or usage of the rule of thirds. Spectacular photo, though!', '2007-03-29 14:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
