(3496998, 489523, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait shot, but I''m not sure how a viewer would know you met the challenge from the image itself without the help the title.</td>', 'Nice portrait shot, but I''m not sure how a viewer would know you met the challenge from the image itself without the help the title.', '2007-03-29 14:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497003, 489121, 61651, '<td valign="top">This has a beautiful otherworldly feel, and meets the requirements to convey stillness.</td>', 'This has a beautiful otherworldly feel, and meets the requirements to convey stillness.', '2007-03-29 14:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497008, 489425, 61651, '<td valign="top">I love the range of tones in this image, and the derelict look to the fan underscores the point that its function has been stilled.</td>', 'I love the range of tones in this image, and the derelict look to the fan underscores the point that its function has been stilled.', '2007-03-29 14:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497013, 487616, 61651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - sharp and focused, and well-isolated, with nice bokeh.  I don''t know how to explain how such an image conveys "still", but at least in my opinion you achieved it here.</td>', 'Beautiful - sharp and focused, and well-isolated, with nice bokeh.  I don''t know how to explain how such an image conveys "still", but at least in my opinion you achieved it here.', '2007-03-29 14:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497017, 489355, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the wide expanse (fisheye?) suits this shot and conveys utter stillness.</td>', 'Very nice, the wide expanse (fisheye?) suits this shot and conveys utter stillness.', '2007-03-29 14:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497023, 489344, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful - nice composition and bokeh; I get the sense this is the moment just before a breeze lifts it up and way.</td>', 'This is just beautiful - nice composition and bokeh; I get the sense this is the moment just before a breeze lifts it up and way.', '2007-03-29 14:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497027, 489288, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nicely focused still life.</td>', 'Nicely focused still life.', '2007-03-29 14:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497031, 489176, 61651, '<td valign="top">I just really like the sense of desolation you captured here.</td>', 'I just really like the sense of desolation you captured here.', '2007-03-29 14:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497047, 488871, 61651, '<td valign="top">I think this is a fine shot - the reflections and fog emphasize the stillness.  The one detraction for me, and it is a minor one, is the flag pole that juts out in the background.  Would be better to have kept the background just all trees and fog, but it is hard to see how you could have recomposed the shot to leave out the flag pole, and I think removing it later in Photoshop probably violates the basic editing rules - I did not discount your score for it.</td>', 'I think this is a fine shot - the reflections and fog emphasize the stillness.  The one detraction for me, and it is a minor one, is the flag pole that juts out in the background.  Would be better to have kept the background just all trees and fog, but it is hard to see how you could have recomposed the shot to leave out the flag pole, and I think removing it later in Photoshop probably violates the basic editing rules - I did not discount your score for it.', '2007-03-29 15:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497090, 489199, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like the broad view of the sky in this shot - it emphasizes vastness, which helps with conveying the overall stillness of the composition.</td>', 'I like the broad view of the sky in this shot - it emphasizes vastness, which helps with conveying the overall stillness of the composition.', '2007-03-29 15:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497168, 487589, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like this composition, but the boats seem slightly underexposed.  It would be good if the shadows had a bit more detail.  I nice, still shot, though.</td>', 'I like this composition, but the boats seem slightly underexposed.  It would be good if the shadows had a bit more detail.  I nice, still shot, though.', '2007-03-29 15:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497172, 488832, 30822, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Wall by staircase seems blown out and the reflection on the black areas make the whole shot seem soft IMHO.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Wall by staircase seems blown out and the reflection on the black areas make the whole shot seem soft IMHO.', '2007-03-29 16:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497174, 489157, 30822, '<td valign="top">Maybe could have straightned the image and included the whole sign.</td>', 'Maybe could have straightned the image and included the whole sign.', '2007-03-29 16:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497176, 487260, 30822, '<td valign="top">Focus is very soft IMHO</td>', 'Focus is very soft IMHO', '2007-03-29 16:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497177, 489483, 61651, '<td valign="top">I like this - a spare and enigmatic image.  To me, it expresses quietude.</td>', 'I like this - a spare and enigmatic image.  To me, it expresses quietude.', '2007-03-29 16:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497179, 489060, 30822, '<td valign="top">Image seems very soft to me.</td>', 'Image seems very soft to me.', '2007-03-29 16:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497180, 489468, 61651, '<td valign="top">I really like the selective focus in this shot.</td>', 'I really like the selective focus in this shot.', '2007-03-29 16:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
