(3497751, 486774, 61961, '<td valign="top">Sorry, a low score from me.  The plastic is harshly lit and ugly -- is it all plastic?  I guess that''s a chopstick, but it looks like a dental implement.  Apparently photographed with little care.</td>', 'Sorry, a low score from me.  The plastic is harshly lit and ugly -- is it all plastic?  I guess that''s a chopstick, but it looks like a dental implement.  Apparently photographed with little care.', '2007-03-29 18:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497752, 487752, 63588, '<td valign="top">Excellent captures - love the facial expression. I can feel the action in this image and that''s a good thing - except in a "still'' challenge (I understand your connection).</td>', 'Excellent captures - love the facial expression. I can feel the action in this image and that''s a good thing - except in a "still'' challenge (I understand your connection).', '2007-03-29 18:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497754, 487608, 61961, '<td valign="top">I give this a low score because it does make me want to know what is going on here, but really, it''s a murky photo with odd specs of light here and there.</td>', 'I give this a low score because it does make me want to know what is going on here, but really, it''s a murky photo with odd specs of light here and there.', '2007-03-29 18:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497755, 488051, 63588, '<td valign="top">I like your composition here and the boy''s expression is fabulous. He seems a little soft though.</td>', 'I like your composition here and the boy''s expression is fabulous. He seems a little soft though.', '2007-03-29 18:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497756, 488347, 63588, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2007-03-29 18:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497757, 489182, 61961, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, sorry to give this such a low score, but it is out of focus, the ceiling light is over-exposed, and the tilted composition serves no purpose.  Doesn''t fit the challenge, either, does it?</td>', 'Hmmm, sorry to give this such a low score, but it is out of focus, the ceiling light is over-exposed, and the tilted composition serves no purpose.  Doesn''t fit the challenge, either, does it?', '2007-03-29 18:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497758, 489589, 63588, '<td valign="top">What an interesting image. I''d like it better if the horse''s head were more visible.</td>', 'What an interesting image. I''d like it better if the horse''s head were more visible.', '2007-03-29 18:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497761, 488683, 63588, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection. The image doesn''t feel "still" because of the movement in the water.</td>', 'Nice reflection. The image doesn''t feel "still" because of the movement in the water.', '2007-03-29 18:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497764, 488300, 63588, '<td valign="top">This image made me smile.</td>', 'This image made me smile.', '2007-03-29 18:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497768, 488871, 67237, '<td valign="top">stunning image..(9)</td>', 'stunning image..(9)', '2007-03-29 18:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497772, 489482, 63588, '<td valign="top">I like this image a lot. The texture, composition, dof all work for me. It falls a tad short of "still" because the nostrils aren''t even - makes me feel like the mouth isn''t still...for whatever that''s worth. I like it though.</td>', 'I like this image a lot. The texture, composition, dof all work for me. It falls a tad short of "still" because the nostrils aren''t even - makes me feel like the mouth isn''t still...for whatever that''s worth. I like it though.', '2007-03-29 18:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497776, 488111, 63588, '<td valign="top">The bright background is pretty distracting. But I can see the stillness in the cat - that intent gaze cats get while stalking.</td>', 'The bright background is pretty distracting. But I can see the stillness in the cat - that intent gaze cats get while stalking.', '2007-03-29 18:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497777, 488418, 63588, '<td valign="top">I would prefer the rail to be in focus n the foreground - it bugs my eyes for it to be so blurry. I like the perspective you took with this.</td>', 'I would prefer the rail to be in focus n the foreground - it bugs my eyes for it to be so blurry. I like the perspective you took with this.', '2007-03-29 18:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497778, 489135, 63588, '<td valign="top">This feels the slightest bit tilted to me but that could be an illusion. Rich colors.</td>', 'This feels the slightest bit tilted to me but that could be an illusion. Rich colors.', '2007-03-29 18:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497779, 486860, 63588, '<td valign="top">I like the idea you have here. I think I''d like it better if the empty space were in front of the cat face "giving room to pounce"</td>', 'I like the idea you have here. I think I''d like it better if the empty space were in front of the cat face "giving room to pounce"', '2007-03-29 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497782, 489259, 63588, '<td valign="top">There feels like there''s a story here but I can''t quite grasp it. I''m not sure why she would be standing still in that location. I''m looking for clues from the background and I realize I may just not be getting it. I really like the concept.</td>', 'There feels like there''s a story here but I can''t quite grasp it. I''m not sure why she would be standing still in that location. I''m looking for clues from the background and I realize I may just not be getting it. I really like the concept.', '2007-03-29 18:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497785, 487705, 63588, '<td valign="top">Oh my! What an amazing portrait.</td>', 'Oh my! What an amazing portrait.', '2007-03-29 18:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497786, 489383, 63588, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes. To me it reminds me of kids sucked in to a TV which I agree is "still" but vacant (vs. at peace or calm or something like that which is more interesting as a photo. Don''t know if that makes any sense but wanted to try to explain my reaction.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes. To me it reminds me of kids sucked in to a TV which I agree is "still" but vacant (vs. at peace or calm or something like that which is more interesting as a photo. Don''t know if that makes any sense but wanted to try to explain my reaction.', '2007-03-29 18:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497789, 488766, 63588, '<td valign="top">I like this idea. Too bad there wasn''t any snow on the swing that would have been neat. The cross beam of the play structure is very strong in this images and it took my eyes a moment to back off that to "see" the swing. I think it would have been better if the swing/chain were stronger lines n the photo.</td>', 'I like this idea. Too bad there wasn''t any snow on the swing that would have been neat. The cross beam of the play structure is very strong in this images and it took my eyes a moment to back off that to "see" the swing. I think it would have been better if the swing/chain were stronger lines n the photo.', '2007-03-29 18:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497790, 488757, 63588, '<td valign="top">I think I would like this more if the man were on the right side of the image (in the 1/3 position).</td>', 'I think I would like this more if the man were on the right side of the image (in the 1/3 position).', '2007-03-29 18:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497792, 486707, 63588, '<td valign="top">Cute. A yawn doesn''t seem very still though.</td>', 'Cute. A yawn doesn''t seem very still though.', '2007-03-29 18:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497794, 489505, 63588, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and colors - very warm and still. Really like the composition here.</td>', 'Nice texture and colors - very warm and still. Really like the composition here.', '2007-03-29 18:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497796, 489335, 63588, '<td valign="top">I like how the strong sun is breaking in on the top right of this photo - almost as if you can see the man being pushed by the light. This image doesn''t say "still" to me in anyway (other than freezing the motion).</td>', 'I like how the strong sun is breaking in on the top right of this photo - almost as if you can see the man being pushed by the light. This image doesn''t say "still" to me in anyway (other than freezing the motion).', '2007-03-29 18:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
