(3497835, 488994, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach to the challenge. The black and white conversion works well here. There is a bit of tilt to the picture that is evident in the posts of the dock. (Slight but still distracting).  <br/> <br/>The composition is alright. The boards of the pier kind of take the eye out of the frame though. The verticals of the pier do help anchor the image well. (Perhaps why I noticed that they were a little tilted). <br/> <br/>Exposure is good and there a good range of tonality to the image. <br/> <br/>The challenge: Water is quite common in this challenge however this is a fresh take on that theme. The black and white conversion does give this a peaceful feeling that really sells the viewer on this shots relevance to the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting approach to the challenge. The black and white conversion works well here. There is a bit of tilt to the picture that is evident in the posts of the dock. (Slight but still distracting).   The composition is alright. The boards of the pier kind of take the eye out of the frame though. The verticals of the pier do help anchor the image well. (Perhaps why I noticed that they were a little tilted).  Exposure is good and there a good range of tonality to the image.  The challenge: Water is quite common in this challenge however this is a fresh take on that theme. The black and white conversion does give this a peaceful feeling that really sells the viewer on this shots relevance to the challenge.', '2007-03-29 19:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497838, 489561, 63588, '<td valign="top">Nice freezing of the action but overall the image makes me feel the movement of the water.</td>', 'Nice freezing of the action but overall the image makes me feel the movement of the water.', '2007-03-29 19:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497840, 489506, 63588, '<td valign="top">The bright and saturated greens and blues don''t seem quite the mood for the old house.Nice composition and amazing that it is still standing!</td>', 'The bright and saturated greens and blues don''t seem quite the mood for the old house.Nice composition and amazing that it is still standing!', '2007-03-29 19:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497847, 489387, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of reflections in this shot. The angled composition works well in this case as it draws the eye throughout the picture and creates drama.<br/> <br/>The colors are rich and vary from subtle to bold creating visual appeal. <br/> <br/>The exposure is great here and well controlled. Post processing appears to have enhanced some already good contrast above while leaving the subtle details in the reflection below. <br/> <br/>The challenge: The colors and the props you have chosen work well with the challenge. Normally one could argue that the diagonal composition wouldn''t give the viewer a feeling of peace however in this case it does somehow.</td>', 'Interesting use of reflections in this shot. The angled composition works well in this case as it draws the eye throughout the picture and creates drama. The colors are rich and vary from subtle to bold creating visual appeal.  The exposure is great here and well controlled. Post processing appears to have enhanced some already good contrast above while leaving the subtle details in the reflection below.  The challenge: The colors and the props you have chosen work well with the challenge. Normally one could argue that the diagonal composition wouldn''t give the viewer a feeling of peace however in this case it does somehow.', '2007-03-29 19:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3497848, 489542, 63588, '<td valign="top">The oof leaf in the bottom right is distracting. Nice capture!</td>', 'The oof leaf in the bottom right is distracting. Nice capture!', '2007-03-29 19:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
