(3498248, 487554, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors captured here. Stranged processing hurts this image. (The grass and the trees appear to be oversharpened and look unnatural. <br/> <br/>I like the way the trees frame the picture however they are quite dominating in the scene. <br/> <br/>The composition is okay but it could be stronger. I think this compostion is a sort of compromise. Its not really emphasizing any one element. The composition could be changed the to lend emphasis to the sky for instance or to the reflections in the water.<br/> <br/>The challenge:<br/>A still reflection certainly is a given for this challenge. The strange processing in the trees give this a harsh feeling however and create a sense of agitation rather than calm. Softer lines would accentuate the feeling you were going for.</td>', 'Interesting colors captured here. Stranged processing hurts this image. (The grass and the trees appear to be oversharpened and look unnatural.  I like the way the trees frame the picture however they are quite dominating in the scene.  The composition is okay but it could be stronger. I think this compostion is a sort of compromise. Its not really emphasizing any one element. The composition could be changed the to lend emphasis to the sky for instance or to the reflections in the water. The challenge:A still reflection certainly is a given for this challenge. The strange processing in the trees give this a harsh feeling however and create a sense of agitation rather than calm. Softer lines would accentuate the feeling you were going for.', '2007-03-29 22:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498307, 489368, 61961, '<td valign="top">The photo is too small to judge fairly, but my impression is that you snuck up behind a stranger and snapped his photo without concern for camera settings.  One quick improvement might be to get down lower so it doesn''t look like you are standing over him in a tourist stance.</td>', 'The photo is too small to judge fairly, but my impression is that you snuck up behind a stranger and snapped his photo without concern for camera settings.  One quick improvement might be to get down lower so it doesn''t look like you are standing over him in a tourist stance.', '2007-03-29 22:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498312, 487567, 61961, '<td valign="top">Aside from the dual-language hosptital sign, there''s not much of interest in this photo.  The building is very distorted.  What is the yellow blob on the left?  It''s not apparent that this is about lack of wind because the way the windsock is built it looks like it is partly inflated.</td>', 'Aside from the dual-language hosptital sign, there''s not much of interest in this photo.  The building is very distorted.  What is the yellow blob on the left?  It''s not apparent that this is about lack of wind because the way the windsock is built it looks like it is partly inflated.', '2007-03-29 22:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498319, 489280, 61961, '<td valign="top">It looks like you used a flash, which is odd when capturing candlelight.  The glass/candle is out of focus, it appears you used automatic focus and it focussed on the closest object.  A deeper depth of field might have helped keep everything in focus.  This doesn''t say "still" to me.</td>', 'It looks like you used a flash, which is odd when capturing candlelight.  The glass/candle is out of focus, it appears you used automatic focus and it focussed on the closest object.  A deeper depth of field might have helped keep everything in focus.  This doesn''t say "still" to me.', '2007-03-29 22:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498324, 488347, 70514, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a spooky Halloween picture.  Nice purple!</td>', 'Reminds me of a spooky Halloween picture.  Nice purple!', '2007-03-29 22:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498326, 489381, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice blue eyes.</td>', 'Nice blue eyes.', '2007-03-29 22:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498327, 489556, 61961, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t seem to meet the challenge theme, unless in a general sense it''s a "still" life, or perhaps a statue/figurine implies "still."  Plastic is ugly by nature and hard to photograph.  Credit to you for using depth of field to your advantage.</td>', 'This doesn''t seem to meet the challenge theme, unless in a general sense it''s a "still" life, or perhaps a statue/figurine implies "still."  Plastic is ugly by nature and hard to photograph.  Credit to you for using depth of field to your advantage.', '2007-03-29 22:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498329, 486949, 70514, '<td valign="top">Quite creepy!  (not a bad thing)</td>', 'Quite creepy!  (not a bad thing)', '2007-03-29 22:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498331, 488138, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great water droplet and reflection!</td>', 'Great water droplet and reflection!', '2007-03-29 22:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498336, 488418, 61961, '<td valign="top">A low score from me because the photo is too small and the sky appears washed out.  You may have been trying to catch a reflection in the rail, but the centered composition is fairly dull.</td>', 'A low score from me because the photo is too small and the sky appears washed out.  You may have been trying to catch a reflection in the rail, but the centered composition is fairly dull.', '2007-03-29 22:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498337, 487482, 70514, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!', '2007-03-29 22:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498341, 489302, 61961, '<td valign="top">A low score from me because the doll shines with reflected light and the shirt on the left is overexposed.  I don''t think b&amp;w has improved this photo -- some garish colors might have helped!</td>', 'A low score from me because the doll shines with reflected light and the shirt on the left is overexposed.  I don''t think b&w has improved this photo -- some garish colors might have helped!', '2007-03-29 22:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498344, 487260, 61961, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, the frame works okay, but it is way too blurry.</td>', 'Nice colors, the frame works okay, but it is way too blurry.', '2007-03-29 22:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498345, 488042, 70514, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the lighting in the center background of the tree.  Really draws my attention in.  I also like the colors.</td>', 'I really enjoy the lighting in the center background of the tree.  Really draws my attention in.  I also like the colors.', '2007-03-29 22:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498351, 487823, 61961, '<td valign="top">I thought I''d left a comment on this but it didn''t seem to stick.  Anyway, I think a real frog might have been interesting, but this is kind of an ugly object, the face is shadowed and the top too shiny.  The leaf in front is overexposed.</td>', 'I thought I''d left a comment on this but it didn''t seem to stick.  Anyway, I think a real frog might have been interesting, but this is kind of an ugly object, the face is shadowed and the top too shiny.  The leaf in front is overexposed.', '2007-03-29 22:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498352, 489513, 61961, '<td valign="top">The photo should say "still" without the caption.  This doesn''t seem still because either the fronds are blowing or it is out of focus.</td>', 'The photo should say "still" without the caption.  This doesn''t seem still because either the fronds are blowing or it is out of focus.', '2007-03-29 22:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498426, 488821, 61961, '<td valign="top">You''ve gathered a cornucopia of fruits and vegetables, and then we can''t see them!  Yellow corn, red apples, green grapes, etc -- this should be a colorful photo.  As a minor quibble, I wouldn''t use broken corn like the chopped off piece at center unless I was making a statement about it, it''s very strange visually.</td>', 'You''ve gathered a cornucopia of fruits and vegetables, and then we can''t see them!  Yellow corn, red apples, green grapes, etc -- this should be a colorful photo.  As a minor quibble, I wouldn''t use broken corn like the chopped off piece at center unless I was making a statement about it, it''s very strange visually.', '2007-03-29 23:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498430, 487342, 61961, '<td valign="top">The farm implement doesn''t seem to be in focus, and your sky is terribly washed out.  Putting the object dead center is sort of a dull composition, as is putting your horizon line at center.</td>', 'The farm implement doesn''t seem to be in focus, and your sky is terribly washed out.  Putting the object dead center is sort of a dull composition, as is putting your horizon line at center.', '2007-03-29 23:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498434, 488111, 61961, '<td valign="top">Even though you most likely stuck to the basic editing rules, the washed out background makes this look like you cut and pasted the cat onto a white background.</td>', 'Even though you most likely stuck to the basic editing rules, the washed out background makes this look like you cut and pasted the cat onto a white background.', '2007-03-29 23:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498437, 487628, 70181, '<td valign="top">Great closeup.  Very crisp.  Excellent depth of field.</td>', 'Great closeup.  Very crisp.  Excellent depth of field.', '2007-03-29 23:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498441, 487898, 61961, '<td valign="top">With all the moving water, this photo doesn''t say calm or still to me.  The flower is presumably your point of focus, but it isn''t in focus.</td>', 'With all the moving water, this photo doesn''t say calm or still to me.  The flower is presumably your point of focus, but it isn''t in focus.', '2007-03-29 23:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498445, 486827, 70181, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Great angle, excellent colors.  It''s a little too bright in the center of the flower, you''ve lost some of the detail.  But still a very nice photo.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Great angle, excellent colors.  It''s a little too bright in the center of the flower, you''ve lost some of the detail.  But still a very nice photo.', '2007-03-29 23:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498446, 489121, 70181, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful.', '2007-03-29 23:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498447, 488245, 70181, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I love the color.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I love the color.', '2007-03-29 23:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498449, 489060, 61961, '<td valign="top">These waters aren''t "still" at all.  The water also seems out of focus.</td>', 'These waters aren''t "still" at all.  The water also seems out of focus.', '2007-03-29 23:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498452, 489250, 70181, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, nice reflection.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, nice reflection.', '2007-03-29 23:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498456, 489504, 61961, '<td valign="top">This is a coin standing on a mirror, right?  It doesn''t say "still" because the coin seems to be falling.  The coin is too dark, not really a silhouette, though.  The dark area at the front of the mirror looks like a mouth, and the center is a bit overexposed.</td>', 'This is a coin standing on a mirror, right?  It doesn''t say "still" because the coin seems to be falling.  The coin is too dark, not really a silhouette, though.  The dark area at the front of the mirror looks like a mouth, and the center is a bit overexposed.', '2007-03-29 23:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498457, 487768, 61961, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the theme, I suppose, though without the caption it wouldn''t make sense at all.  The statue is either out of focus or too grainy, and it is poorly lit: the glare spots are a problem.  The composition is okay, though it would be better if the curtain in back was less visible.</td>', 'Interesting take on the theme, I suppose, though without the caption it wouldn''t make sense at all.  The statue is either out of focus or too grainy, and it is poorly lit: the glare spots are a problem.  The composition is okay, though it would be better if the curtain in back was less visible.', '2007-03-29 23:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498488, 489328, 74037, '<td valign="top">the pole on the right is a little distracting</td>', 'the pole on the right is a little distracting', '2007-03-29 23:29:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498489, 487554, 70181, '<td valign="top">It''s got nice composition and has the potential to be a beautiful shot, you just overdid it in the post-processing.</td>', 'It''s got nice composition and has the potential to be a beautiful shot, you just overdid it in the post-processing.', '2007-03-29 23:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498494, 489527, 74037, '<td valign="top">the trees on top right corner look like skyscrapers</td>', 'the trees on top right corner look like skyscrapers', '2007-03-29 23:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3498497, 487260, 70181, '<td valign="top">Very out of focus.  And why the large white border?</td>', 'Very out of focus.  And why the large white border?', '2007-03-29 23:31:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
