(3499941, 487384, 73235, '<td valign="top">the picture seems to be very grainy/noisy, especially around the bird itself. Too bad the head of the bird melts righ into it''s right wing.</td>', 'the picture seems to be very grainy/noisy, especially around the bird itself. Too bad the head of the bird melts righ into it''s right wing.', '2007-03-30 15:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499944, 489183, 73235, '<td valign="top">very nice interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'very nice interpretation of the challenge.', '2007-03-30 15:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499952, 487082, 73235, '<td valign="top">oh yes, this is still. great capture of the scene. very simple and strong composition.</td>', 'oh yes, this is still. great capture of the scene. very simple and strong composition.', '2007-03-30 15:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499959, 488661, 74765, '<td valign="top">The lower dark half of the picture doesn''t really add anything, might work better slightly cropped, otherwise a nice strong shot.</td>', 'The lower dark half of the picture doesn''t really add anything, might work better slightly cropped, otherwise a nice strong shot.', '2007-03-30 15:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499966, 488832, 73235, '<td valign="top">I think this could be a good candidate for b/w conversion. There are barely colors in the photo anyhow. My impression here is not one of stillness. There are many conflicting lines and curves in the picture. Jagged lines are usually a style element of change and dynamic. the photo is too busy to create create the emotion of still ness. Did you try a different angle and a tight crop aroung the center circle and the rock?</td>', 'I think this could be a good candidate for b/w conversion. There are barely colors in the photo anyhow. My impression here is not one of stillness. There are many conflicting lines and curves in the picture. Jagged lines are usually a style element of change and dynamic. the photo is too busy to create create the emotion of still ness. Did you try a different angle and a tight crop aroung the center circle and the rock?', '2007-03-30 15:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499969, 489189, 73235, '<td valign="top">very detailed and sharp shot</td>', 'very detailed and sharp shot', '2007-03-30 15:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499974, 489260, 73235, '<td valign="top">nice composition and transition of colors. That giant surely dwarfs the trees. Nice warm capture - approppriate for STILL</td>', 'nice composition and transition of colors. That giant surely dwarfs the trees. Nice warm capture - approppriate for STILL', '2007-03-30 15:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499975, 487565, 73235, '<td valign="top">great night shot. excellent exposure and sharpness</td>', 'great night shot. excellent exposure and sharpness', '2007-03-30 15:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499981, 489524, 34134, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but the horizon needs to be leveled.</td>', 'Nice capture, but the horizon needs to be leveled.', '2007-03-30 15:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3499984, 488884, 73235, '<td valign="top">ducks and a sunset, sitting on a bench and dreaming...<br/>did your UV filter create the additoinal reflection of the sun to the right?</td>', 'ducks and a sunset, sitting on a bench and dreaming...did your UV filter create the additoinal reflection of the sun to the right?', '2007-03-30 15:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
