(3502281, 488335, 62187, '<td valign="top">I love aviation photography, in the past I''ve tried to avoid voting on them. To me, this is beautiful. Knowing the challenge called for basic editing, I might have tried a different angle to avoid the sky - I think it''s lack of color and slight noise detract from the overall beauty. I''ll go with better then average and give it an 8.</td>', 'I love aviation photography, in the past I''ve tried to avoid voting on them. To me, this is beautiful. Knowing the challenge called for basic editing, I might have tried a different angle to avoid the sky - I think it''s lack of color and slight noise detract from the overall beauty. I''ll go with better then average and give it an 8.', '2007-03-31 15:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502290, 488883, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s gotta be Utah. It looks a little out of focus to me. I think a conversion to B&amp;W, heavy on the contrast and some sharpening would really have improved your photo. That''s just me though. So, is it Utah?</td>', 'It''s gotta be Utah. It looks a little out of focus to me. I think a conversion to B&W, heavy on the contrast and some sharpening would really have improved your photo. That''s just me though. So, is it Utah?', '2007-03-31 15:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502295, 487986, 62187, '<td valign="top">Second photo in the challenge that I''m almost positive was taken in Utah. Very nice observation. Too bad for basic edit - I think this could have been a stunner with advanced. Going with a 7</td>', 'Second photo in the challenge that I''m almost positive was taken in Utah. Very nice observation. Too bad for basic edit - I think this could have been a stunner with advanced. Going with a 7', '2007-03-31 15:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502302, 488234, 62187, '<td valign="top">Something looks almost cut-and-paste about the photo. I think maybe oversharpening? The color is very nice.</td>', 'Something looks almost cut-and-paste about the photo. I think maybe oversharpening? The color is very nice.', '2007-03-31 15:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502305, 489387, 62187, '<td valign="top">An excellent job with the camera. Love the colors - 10</td>', 'An excellent job with the camera. Love the colors - 10', '2007-03-31 15:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502310, 486860, 62187, '<td valign="top">I like it! The framing is backwards, should be more dead space where the cat is looking but I like that too. I wish the highlights could have been just a tad bit brighter but I think it''s too ''oof'' for that. I can tell you tried to sharpen it (in the whiskers). I think if you had converted it to black and white and turned up the contrast you''d have achieved the desired effect you had inteneded? I might be wrong but I don''t think the other voters will like your photo that much. Just in case, I''ll help it along and go with an 8.</td>', 'I like it! The framing is backwards, should be more dead space where the cat is looking but I like that too. I wish the highlights could have been just a tad bit brighter but I think it''s too ''oof'' for that. I can tell you tried to sharpen it (in the whiskers). I think if you had converted it to black and white and turned up the contrast you''d have achieved the desired effect you had inteneded? I might be wrong but I don''t think the other voters will like your photo that much. Just in case, I''ll help it along and go with an 8.', '2007-03-31 16:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
