(3502826, 489462, 61961, '<td valign="top">I had to see your caption before I understood this wasn''t a shot of a moving object.  I like the colors, though the sky is a bit unnatural.  Do you need to clean your lens?  I''d say clone out the spots along the top, or is that against editing rules?</td>', 'I had to see your caption before I understood this wasn''t a shot of a moving object.  I like the colors, though the sky is a bit unnatural.  Do you need to clean your lens?  I''d say clone out the spots along the top, or is that against editing rules?', '2007-03-31 22:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502829, 489293, 61961, '<td valign="top">B&amp;w works well, I wish the lake were a bit more still.  I think composition would be improved if the foreground plants were less intrusive and the horizon line wasn''t centered.</td>', 'B&w works well, I wish the lake were a bit more still.  I think composition would be improved if the foreground plants were less intrusive and the horizon line wasn''t centered.', '2007-03-31 22:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502830, 489512, 61961, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t quite work for me, I wish I could put my finger on why -- maybe because, despite the even row of bricks at the top, the photo appears to tilt ever-so-slightly to the left.  Still (even so), there is something appealing here.</td>', 'Doesn''t quite work for me, I wish I could put my finger on why -- maybe because, despite the even row of bricks at the top, the photo appears to tilt ever-so-slightly to the left.  Still (even so), there is something appealing here.', '2007-03-31 22:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502831, 489328, 61961, '<td valign="top">Paths and morning mist always make an interesting photo, I wish the sky weren''t so washed out.</td>', 'Paths and morning mist always make an interesting photo, I wish the sky weren''t so washed out.', '2007-03-31 22:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502832, 486827, 61961, '<td valign="top">Good bright color, excellent sky color, and the point of view works.  Doesn''t scream "stillness", though I presume there was no wind.  Not to offend, but lily is spelled with one ''l'' (Lilly with two ls is the drug company). :-)</td>', 'Good bright color, excellent sky color, and the point of view works.  Doesn''t scream "stillness", though I presume there was no wind.  Not to offend, but lily is spelled with one ''l'' (Lilly with two ls is the drug company). :-)', '2007-03-31 22:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502833, 486949, 61961, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.  Not sure how this fits the theme, but a lot more things come to mind before "still".  Anyway, a quirky photo, the mask and the suit make a nice juxtaposition, and the eyes looking upward really add to the interest.</td>', 'Hmmm.  Not sure how this fits the theme, but a lot more things come to mind before "still".  Anyway, a quirky photo, the mask and the suit make a nice juxtaposition, and the eyes looking upward really add to the interest.', '2007-03-31 22:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502835, 489482, 61961, '<td valign="top">Really lovely photo, but points off I''m afraid because it doesn''t fit the theme for me, caption notwithstanding.</td>', 'Really lovely photo, but points off I''m afraid because it doesn''t fit the theme for me, caption notwithstanding.', '2007-03-31 22:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502837, 487016, 61961, '<td valign="top">This could use some rotation (too bad it''s not allowed).  The horizon line at center is a bit dull, especially considering you''ve got all this black space at the bottom you cut off the top of the tree.</td>', 'This could use some rotation (too bad it''s not allowed).  The horizon line at center is a bit dull, especially considering you''ve got all this black space at the bottom you cut off the top of the tree.', '2007-03-31 22:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502838, 487300, 61961, '<td valign="top">Is this percol0768?  It seems very similar to your entry in the multiple light source challenge, although this has a little more depth.  Unfortunately it is far too small to judge fairly.  The snowflakes I think were shot with a flash and look unnaturally huge.</td>', 'Is this percol0768?  It seems very similar to your entry in the multiple light source challenge, although this has a little more depth.  Unfortunately it is far too small to judge fairly.  The snowflakes I think were shot with a flash and look unnaturally huge.', '2007-03-31 22:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502840, 489151, 61961, '<td valign="top">Needs to be sharper, I think.</td>', 'Needs to be sharper, I think.', '2007-03-31 22:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502843, 488841, 61961, '<td valign="top">Interesting low angle, but too harshly lit (especially noticeable on the stem and the ladybug''s back).  We can''t really see the more interesting side of the ladybug.</td>', 'Interesting low angle, but too harshly lit (especially noticeable on the stem and the ladybug''s back).  We can''t really see the more interesting side of the ladybug.', '2007-03-31 22:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502844, 489135, 61961, '<td valign="top">Could be sharper.  Too bad tilt fixes (rotations) are not allowed.  Looks like a fascinating edifice.</td>', 'Could be sharper.  Too bad tilt fixes (rotations) are not allowed.  Looks like a fascinating edifice.', '2007-03-31 22:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502845, 488692, 61961, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would be improved without the spots/beads of moisture on the martini glass.  Am I right that the editing rules don''t allow for partial rotation?  Otherwise, I''d suggest straightening the horizon line as it seems to tilt.  Good luck!</td>', 'I think this shot would be improved without the spots/beads of moisture on the martini glass.  Am I right that the editing rules don''t allow for partial rotation?  Otherwise, I''d suggest straightening the horizon line as it seems to tilt.  Good luck!', '2007-03-31 22:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502847, 487296, 61961, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t convey stillness to me.  Because it''s a silhouette, I think it requires a strong composition.</td>', 'Doesn''t convey stillness to me.  Because it''s a silhouette, I think it requires a strong composition.', '2007-03-31 22:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502849, 489353, 61961, '<td valign="top">"Still" as in statue?  Anyway, photographed in too harsh sunlight.  Sort of looks like a tourist snap, maybe a more interesting angle (and shallower depth of field) would improve this.</td>', '"Still" as in statue?  Anyway, photographed in too harsh sunlight.  Sort of looks like a tourist snap, maybe a more interesting angle (and shallower depth of field) would improve this.', '2007-03-31 22:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502850, 488184, 61961, '<td valign="top">I don''t intend to be mean, but be wary of the word "perfect."  The edges of the silhouette seems a bit blurred, and the tail is cut off by the bush (I assume if you moved to correct, the sun would have shown directly into your lens).  Nice colors and concept, but the bush dominates too much.</td>', 'I don''t intend to be mean, but be wary of the word "perfect."  The edges of the silhouette seems a bit blurred, and the tail is cut off by the bush (I assume if you moved to correct, the sun would have shown directly into your lens).  Nice colors and concept, but the bush dominates too much.', '2007-03-31 22:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502851, 488750, 61961, '<td valign="top">Funny crop, and the eyes looking up are comical, highlighted by the dark skin tones against the bright green.  Unfortunately the lighting (flash?) is terrible.  A smoother background might have helped, too (another challenge would have permitted you to clone out the wall imperfections).</td>', 'Funny crop, and the eyes looking up are comical, highlighted by the dark skin tones against the bright green.  Unfortunately the lighting (flash?) is terrible.  A smoother background might have helped, too (another challenge would have permitted you to clone out the wall imperfections).', '2007-03-31 22:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3502852, 487126, 61961, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this doesn''t say "still" to me at all -- it''s very busy.  It''s hard to tell what the point of the photo is without the caption.</td>', 'I''m afraid this doesn''t say "still" to me at all -- it''s very busy.  It''s hard to tell what the point of the photo is without the caption.', '2007-03-31 22:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
