(3508574, 488172, 76389, '<td valign="top">The theme of "still" is expressed by the contrasting blurr of the people in motion. The things which are still are in sharp focus. The photographer further catches the eye by the use of color to emphasize those things which are still. The things in motion almost appear black and white in contrast. Altogether, however, this image doesn''t really do anything for me.</td>', 'The theme of "still" is expressed by the contrasting blurr of the people in motion. The things which are still are in sharp focus. The photographer further catches the eye by the use of color to emphasize those things which are still. The things in motion almost appear black and white in contrast. Altogether, however, this image doesn''t really do anything for me.', '2007-04-02 01:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508592, 489506, 76389, '<td valign="top">There is irony in this image. Obviously the house is still but it suggests motion by its slant which mimicks the tree. Together they seem to be like the blown back hair shots one gets from people in a convertable.  The linear horizon and clouds add a sense of direction making this a strong image.</td>', 'There is irony in this image. Obviously the house is still but it suggests motion by its slant which mimicks the tree. Together they seem to be like the blown back hair shots one gets from people in a convertable.  The linear horizon and clouds add a sense of direction making this a strong image.', '2007-04-02 02:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508777, 488698, 16241, '<td valign="top">lovely shot.</td>', 'lovely shot.', '2007-04-02 03:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
