(3508937, 489411, 28070, '<td valign="top">There is not a well defined pop out area to look at.  My eyes keep searching for something to hold onto.  Standing Still?  Good idea, trees are very still.</td>', 'There is not a well defined pop out area to look at.  My eyes keep searching for something to hold onto.  Standing Still?  Good idea, trees are very still.', '2007-04-02 04:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508949, 486774, 28070, '<td valign="top">Good setup, They look like sponges or something rather than sushi. I don''t eat sushi so I don''t know.  The border blends into the picture at the upper left corner not encapsulating the whole image.</td>', 'Good setup, They look like sponges or something rather than sushi. I don''t eat sushi so I don''t know.  The border blends into the picture at the upper left corner not encapsulating the whole image.', '2007-04-02 05:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508958, 487384, 28070, '<td valign="top">Good shot, needs more clarity for more detail on the bird.  Soaring still in the winds of the earth.</td>', 'Good shot, needs more clarity for more detail on the bird.  Soaring still in the winds of the earth.', '2007-04-02 05:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508966, 489504, 28070, '<td valign="top">Good work!  I like the use of such a small border.  Small borders are the best.  I made the mistake of using a huge border on one challenge and ruined my chances though it wasn''t blue ribbon quality anyway.</td>', 'Good work!  I like the use of such a small border.  Small borders are the best.  I made the mistake of using a huge border on one challenge and ruined my chances though it wasn''t blue ribbon quality anyway.', '2007-04-02 05:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508982, 488898, 28070, '<td valign="top">Great Portrait</td>', 'Great Portrait', '2007-04-02 05:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508986, 487685, 28070, '<td valign="top">Good work! I would like this one more if I could get a little closer to the twig and see some detail in it.  Background if really cool.</td>', 'Good work! I would like this one more if I could get a little closer to the twig and see some detail in it.  Background if really cool.', '2007-04-02 05:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508988, 487823, 28070, '<td valign="top">Is that a real frog?  Lighting is to strong on the leaf in the foreground.  Overexposed a little.</td>', 'Is that a real frog?  Lighting is to strong on the leaf in the foreground.  Overexposed a little.', '2007-04-02 05:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508991, 489260, 28070, '<td valign="top">Wow I like it.</td>', 'Wow I like it.', '2007-04-02 05:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3508997, 486797, 28070, '<td valign="top">Great picture! I can''t quite make out clearly what the statue is.  I guess it is a warrior on a horse killing some kind of fish.  The outline isn''t well defined so I had to look for a second to get it.  Good contre-joure though.  Nice thin border.</td>', 'Great picture! I can''t quite make out clearly what the statue is.  I guess it is a warrior on a horse killing some kind of fish.  The outline isn''t well defined so I had to look for a second to get it.  Good contre-joure though.  Nice thin border.', '2007-04-02 05:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
