(3515627, 489032, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a nice sunset and using a single subject adds a lot of impact.  I''d like to offer a couple of thoughts.  <br/> <br/>This is a good instance where using the "rule of thirds" would be an excellent idea.  Putting the tree one third on either side of the image would have really improved the image.  <br/> <br/>Also, the tree is really small in the frame and there''s not a lot else to add interest.  It might have added more interest if you could have filled the frame with more of the tree.<br/> <br/>I understand that neither of these may have been possible (if you were a long way away and clutter on either side of the tree).  Just my thoughts.</td>', 'This is a nice sunset and using a single subject adds a lot of impact.  I''d like to offer a couple of thoughts.   This is a good instance where using the "rule of thirds" would be an excellent idea.  Putting the tree one third on either side of the image would have really improved the image.   Also, the tree is really small in the frame and there''s not a lot else to add interest.  It might have added more interest if you could have filled the frame with more of the tree. I understand that neither of these may have been possible (if you were a long way away and clutter on either side of the tree).  Just my thoughts.', '2007-04-03 19:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515636, 488234, 39679, '<td valign="top">Amazing depth of field!  Nice work.</td>', 'Amazing depth of field!  Nice work.', '2007-04-03 19:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515646, 488902, 39679, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot in black and white.  Not knowing what the colors were, however, it seems like this would be an stunning shot in color.</td>', 'This is a nice shot in black and white.  Not knowing what the colors were, however, it seems like this would be an stunning shot in color.', '2007-04-03 19:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
