(3515813, 487260, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors in this shot. The border is far too large and takes away the <br/>"canvas" that is available for the picture. <br/> <br/>Not really focused well. Exposure is a little strange (perhaps it appears so do the focus issues)<br/> <br/>Composition is okay. Nothing extraordinary beyond what the florist did in creating the arrangement to begin with. <br/> <br/>The challenge: Meets the challenge? Sort of. I don''t get a feeling of stillness in this shot however that again may be due to the focus issues. My eye wanders around the frame trying to find something that is in focus thus creating an "agitated" feeling.</td>', 'Interesting colors in this shot. The border is far too large and takes away the "canvas" that is available for the picture.  Not really focused well. Exposure is a little strange (perhaps it appears so do the focus issues) Composition is okay. Nothing extraordinary beyond what the florist did in creating the arrangement to begin with.  The challenge: Meets the challenge? Sort of. I don''t get a feeling of stillness in this shot however that again may be due to the focus issues. My eye wanders around the frame trying to find something that is in focus thus creating an "agitated" feeling.', '2007-04-03 19:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515836, 488418, 75893, '<td valign="top">I wish it were bigger, looks like a great shot!</td>', 'I wish it were bigger, looks like a great shot!', '2007-04-03 19:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515838, 489202, 75893, '<td valign="top">I love this!</td>', 'I love this!', '2007-04-03 19:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
