(3515854, 488057, 75893, '<td valign="top">I love this, I wish the thing in front wasn''t there, I would love to see this whole shot...it''s beautiful!</td>', 'I love this, I wish the thing in front wasn''t there, I would love to see this whole shot...it''s beautiful!', '2007-04-03 19:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515855, 489032, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture. Good colors that are well saturated. I like the bits of cloud in the sky. The composition could be a bit better. I would like to the horizon a little lower for starters. Its placed using the rule of thirds but the real interest comes from the orange in the sky. If the middle of the orange band was dropped to where the horizon is right now, it would create a lot more "pop". I''m not sure if the tree could be place off center or not but that would also help.</td>', 'Interesting capture. Good colors that are well saturated. I like the bits of cloud in the sky. The composition could be a bit better. I would like to the horizon a little lower for starters. Its placed using the rule of thirds but the real interest comes from the orange in the sky. If the middle of the orange band was dropped to where the horizon is right now, it would create a lot more "pop". I''m not sure if the tree could be place off center or not but that would also help.', '2007-04-03 19:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3515866, 488984, 74953, '<td valign="top">IMO a black background mwould have really made these pop, but still a good picture.</td>', 'IMO a black background mwould have really made these pop, but still a good picture.', '2007-04-03 19:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
