(3516223, 487752, 32147, '<td valign="top">This is a good sports photo.  I''m not so sure it fits the theme of still though.  Even if you are trying to show the lack of spin on the baseball, movement is still implied.</td>', 'This is a good sports photo.  I''m not so sure it fits the theme of still though.  Even if you are trying to show the lack of spin on the baseball, movement is still implied.', '2007-04-03 21:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3516225, 489135, 74858, '<td valign="top">straighten it out and its good</td>', 'straighten it out and its good', '2007-04-03 21:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3516230, 488673, 32147, '<td valign="top">I rather like this photo and spent a few minutes looking at it.  It communicates a certain solitude and quiet.  While some will certainly state that the grain present takes away from it, I think it adds to the feel of frozen time and memories.  <br/> <br/>While I am sure that will a little effort that the photo could be greatly improved with a little bit better capture, its a good shot.  I find myself wondering what it would look like as a wider shot; i.e., a panorama.</td>', 'I rather like this photo and spent a few minutes looking at it.  It communicates a certain solitude and quiet.  While some will certainly state that the grain present takes away from it, I think it adds to the feel of frozen time and memories.   While I am sure that will a little effort that the photo could be greatly improved with a little bit better capture, its a good shot.  I find myself wondering what it would look like as a wider shot; i.e., a panorama.', '2007-04-03 22:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3516237, 488234, 32147, '<td valign="top">good long exposure, but I feel that it is slightly oversaturated and that gives the shot an unrealistic feel.<br/> <br/>wow - just noticed that you had to validate - ugh!  Sorry you had to go through that.</td>', 'good long exposure, but I feel that it is slightly oversaturated and that gives the shot an unrealistic feel. wow - just noticed that you had to validate - ugh!  Sorry you had to go through that.', '2007-04-03 22:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3516239, 489344, 32147, '<td valign="top">very nice.  Looks like a winner!<br/> <br/>Excellent use of bokeh, by the way.</td>', 'very nice.  Looks like a winner! Excellent use of bokeh, by the way.', '2007-04-03 22:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3516243, 488042, 32147, '<td valign="top">good shot that illustrates the theme well.<br/> <br/>The darker edges of the photo (which is probably due to your lens choice, or maybe a polarizer I''m guessing) helps to direct the viewer in.  I like it.</td>', 'good shot that illustrates the theme well. The darker edges of the photo (which is probably due to your lens choice, or maybe a polarizer I''m guessing) helps to direct the viewer in.  I like it.', '2007-04-03 22:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3516245, 489250, 32147, '<td valign="top">great exposure and excellent color response.<br/> <br/>Used a polarizer?</td>', 'great exposure and excellent color response. Used a polarizer?', '2007-04-03 22:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3516250, 487059, 32147, '<td valign="top">This could be a realllllly good shot with a little color work.<br/>I find myself wondering if the flower shouldnt be yellow and not yellow green.<br/>Aside from the color, there is a lot of good detail here.<br/> <br/>good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This could be a realllllly good shot with a little color work.I find myself wondering if the flower shouldnt be yellow and not yellow green.Aside from the color, there is a lot of good detail here. good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-03 22:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3516272, 489560, 32147, '<td valign="top">This would be a very compelling subject if there was something to further direct the viewer.  Personally, I would have shot with an ultrawide lens (something like a 12-24mm), but I would have placed the tractor in the foreground.  <br/> <br/>Or - another way to go about it would be to get a wide shot with the tractor on the horizontal and fill the frame with the lines in the field.  Hard to explain here in textual comments, but this could be an excellent subject to work with.<br/> <br/>I hope that you''ll give it a shot, as I really like rural photography and have taken quite a few harvest shots.<br/> <br/>good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This would be a very compelling subject if there was something to further direct the viewer.  Personally, I would have shot with an ultrawide lens (something like a 12-24mm), but I would have placed the tractor in the foreground.   Or - another way to go about it would be to get a wide shot with the tractor on the horizontal and fill the frame with the lines in the field.  Hard to explain here in textual comments, but this could be an excellent subject to work with. I hope that you''ll give it a shot, as I really like rural photography and have taken quite a few harvest shots. good luck in the challenge.', '2007-04-03 22:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3516278, 489444, 32147, '<td valign="top">man, this would be soooo much better if the fisherman with the pole were alone.  That would really bring this photo up a notch.</td>', 'man, this would be soooo much better if the fisherman with the pole were alone.  That would really bring this photo up a notch.', '2007-04-03 22:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
