(3516392, 487384, 32147, '<td valign="top">I voted this one low simply because it does not communicate any feeling or emotion to the viewer.  Its a snapshot of a bird - nothing more, nothing less.<br/> <br/>If however, the bird were put into perspective with its environment - or other birds - and that composition were to communicate some sort of feeling, then you''d have something.  Even if the bird were composed with some simple background clouds it would elicit a better response (such as the feeling of gliding or flying).<br/> <br/>just my two cents, but I wanted to let you know why I voted low.</td>', 'I voted this one low simply because it does not communicate any feeling or emotion to the viewer.  Its a snapshot of a bird - nothing more, nothing less. If however, the bird were put into perspective with its environment - or other birds - and that composition were to communicate some sort of feeling, then you''d have something.  Even if the bird were composed with some simple background clouds it would elicit a better response (such as the feeling of gliding or flying). just my two cents, but I wanted to let you know why I voted low.', '2007-04-03 22:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3516395, 489199, 32147, '<td valign="top">This should rank very high in the challenge.  Great shot.</td>', 'This should rank very high in the challenge.  Great shot.', '2007-04-03 22:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3516398, 487768, 32147, '<td valign="top">a better exposure or better use of a strobe would help this shot immensely.</td>', 'a better exposure or better use of a strobe would help this shot immensely.', '2007-04-03 22:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
