(3517256, 489101, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors in this shot and I like the catch lights in the models eyes. Normally I don''t like when a subject is looking out of the frame but the model is looking at the makeup artist so it adds some nice "action" so to speak. A little overexposed particularly in the hair and the neck. Were this in advanced editing I would clone out the stray hairs. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Interesting colors in this shot and I like the catch lights in the models eyes. Normally I don''t like when a subject is looking out of the frame but the model is looking at the makeup artist so it adds some nice "action" so to speak. A little overexposed particularly in the hair and the neck. Were this in advanced editing I would clone out the stray hairs.  ', '2007-04-04 03:02:38.000000', NULL, 0),
