(3517347, 488679, 58986, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all who voted for me! :-)<br/> <br/>I''m happy enough with that result from my first entry- no 1''s!!<br/> <br/>Was shot just outside the State Library in my home state of Queensland, Australia.<br/>Was just a walkway dimly lit by very orange lighting (hence the heavy desat!</td>', 'Thanks to all who voted for me! :-) I''m happy enough with that result from my first entry- no 1''s!! Was shot just outside the State Library in my home state of Queensland, Australia.Was just a walkway dimly lit by very orange lighting (hence the heavy desat!', '2007-04-04 03:35:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3517351, 488821, 70689, '<td valign="top">Post Challenge: 23 commenters were very clear about it: I messed up in post processing. I agree. The picture was off colour and dark on purpose, to mimick an old painting, but the result was not pretty, I admit.<br/> <br/>Some people liked the composition though, well <a href="//www.camera-absurda.nl/cornucopia/better_cornucopia.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">here</a> is a decently post-processed version.<br/> <br/>What can I say? Lowest score so far, highest number of comments as well. Thanks for taking the trouble of explaining my mistake to me, I learned from it. <br/></td>', 'Post Challenge: 23 commenters were very clear about it: I messed up in post processing. I agree. The picture was off colour and dark on purpose, to mimick an old painting, but the result was not pretty, I admit. Some people liked the composition though, well here is a decently post-processed version. What can I say? Lowest score so far, highest number of comments as well. Thanks for taking the trouble of explaining my mistake to me, I learned from it. ', '2007-04-04 03:37:09.000000', NULL, 0),
