(3517774, 488138, 52130, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF annd subject. The only thing I would recommend would be to use a little neatimage for the noise and maybe crop it differently. The composition isn''t very strong, I feel like the top op the stem should be coming from a corner instead  of the top center...The way it is now  makes it feel somewhat disjointed b/c the eye automatically wants to go to the center even thought the focus is on the middle left. Just an opinion.</td>', 'Very nice DOF annd subject. The only thing I would recommend would be to use a little neatimage for the noise and maybe crop it differently. The composition isn''t very strong, I feel like the top op the stem should be coming from a corner instead  of the top center...The way it is now  makes it feel somewhat disjointed b/c the eye automatically wants to go to the center even thought the focus is on the middle left. Just an opinion.', '2007-04-04 07:37:58.000000', NULL, 0),
