(3518155, 489477, 67697, '<td valign="top">Deb''s taking pictures with her new camera!  Whoo!  Great idea Deb.  AFter a few challenges you will see that people have a tendency to not really stop and look at the WHOLE photo.  Hopefully some will comeback and realize that your picture has MORE in it than STIL lol.  Did you use a tripod (good idea) or was this hand held?  I think once you master the sharpness on the focus thing you will be soaring up past the 6+ range.  Nice job!</td>', 'Deb''s taking pictures with her new camera!  Whoo!  Great idea Deb.  AFter a few challenges you will see that people have a tendency to not really stop and look at the WHOLE photo.  Hopefully some will comeback and realize that your picture has MORE in it than STIL lol.  Did you use a tripod (good idea) or was this hand held?  I think once you master the sharpness on the focus thing you will be soaring up past the 6+ range.  Nice job!', '2007-04-04 10:12:16.000000', NULL, 0),
