(3518181, 488773, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hmmm people are looking for a wow factor.  I bet if this piece were on a beach or in the mountains or had a comet in the background you REALLY woulda had someone''s attention.  So from here on out, you must strive to take your pictures in geographically exciting locations.  Heh! <br/> <br/>I did not vote in this challenge so I cannot tell you what my reaction to it then would have been.  I think the lighting is awesome, the border is a perfect compliment, and it is STILL.  Good compostition too.  Nice job in my book!</td>', 'Hmmm people are looking for a wow factor.  I bet if this piece were on a beach or in the mountains or had a comet in the background you REALLY woulda had someone''s attention.  So from here on out, you must strive to take your pictures in geographically exciting locations.  Heh!  I did not vote in this challenge so I cannot tell you what my reaction to it then would have been.  I think the lighting is awesome, the border is a perfect compliment, and it is STILL.  Good compostition too.  Nice job in my book!', '2007-04-04 10:16:49.000000', NULL, 0),
