(3518307, 489505, 24454, '<td valign="top">Catherine, this is so beautiful!   I was just telling my husband the other day when I saw a local lake drained with no water in it, but a canoe sitting at the bottom, that any picture with a canoe in it gets an automatic extra point or 2 for appeal and wow factor.   No exception here.  The canoe just adds that touch of class and interest.  <br/> <br/>Even more amazing that it is that pretty with so little editing.  Wow!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Catherine, this is so beautiful!   I was just telling my husband the other day when I saw a local lake drained with no water in it, but a canoe sitting at the bottom, that any picture with a canoe in it gets an automatic extra point or 2 for appeal and wow factor.   No exception here.  The canoe just adds that touch of class and interest.   Even more amazing that it is that pretty with so little editing.  Wow! ', '2007-04-04 10:59:25.000000', NULL, 0),
