(3518777, 487358, 75449, '<td valign="top">Just to explain the title/image a bit more, Chaotic Peace referred to the fact that this turtle is not as serene as it appears. Any harsh movement sends him flying for the water. I didn''t have to help him down, since this is a position he naturally assumes under the heat lamp. And the blurriness is most definitely caused by the not-so-clean aquarium glass I shot through :)</td>', 'Just to explain the title/image a bit more, Chaotic Peace referred to the fact that this turtle is not as serene as it appears. Any harsh movement sends him flying for the water. I didn''t have to help him down, since this is a position he naturally assumes under the heat lamp. And the blurriness is most definitely caused by the not-so-clean aquarium glass I shot through :)', '2007-04-04 13:12:41.000000', NULL, 0),
