(3521532, 489199, 50674, '<td valign="top">Indeed, weather like this is truly rare in Iceland. Ragga has one from the same place <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=424282" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/580/thumb/424282.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/580/thumb/424282.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/580/thumb/424282.jpg"/></a>and at the time, I thought that seemed pretty still.<br/>But it is not enough to be lucky with the weather, you have to be good with the camera too. And you are. This is truly a wonderful image and a worthy ribbon. Congrats. Wish you well in the WPL-final.</td>', 'Indeed, weather like this is truly rare in Iceland. Ragga has one from the same place and at the time, I thought that seemed pretty still.But it is not enough to be lucky with the weather, you have to be good with the camera too. And you are. This is truly a wonderful image and a worthy ribbon. Congrats. Wish you well in the WPL-final.', '2007-04-05 07:17:29.000000', NULL, 0),
