(3524646, 488347, 52992, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jaysonmc:</b></div><hr/><i> Looks like you are really enjoying the new camera. A great shot. I like the color treatment here. Moon is a bit too sharp, I think. Great use of the frame. Congrats on the terrific score! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Basic editing though - I didn''t sharpen the moon itself any more than the rest of the photo.<br/> <br/>It was a daylight shot, which I think helped with the definition of the moon itself.</td>', 'Originally posted by jaysonmc: Looks like you are really enjoying the new camera. A great shot. I like the color treatment here. Moon is a bit too sharp, I think. Great use of the frame. Congrats on the terrific score!   Basic editing though - I didn''t sharpen the moon itself any more than the rest of the photo. It was a daylight shot, which I think helped with the definition of the moon itself.', '2007-04-06 09:29:21.000000', NULL, 0),
