(3525787, 488282, 40973, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bmartuch:</b></div><hr/><i> I think this was done well but I think you should go back at night and do it again.  That would give it a really spooky look.  I agree with Noraneko that the angle is just fine. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Around here, the large, old cemetaries have limited daytime hours and are locked up at night. Even if it were open at night, this would not be a safe place. It''s probably even a creepier place than what it looks.</td>', 'Originally posted by bmartuch: I think this was done well but I think you should go back at night and do it again.  That would give it a really spooky look.  I agree with Noraneko that the angle is just fine.   Around here, the large, old cemetaries have limited daytime hours and are locked up at night. Even if it were open at night, this would not be a safe place. It''s probably even a creepier place than what it looks.', '2007-04-06 17:33:37.000000', NULL, 0),
