(4531235, 486985, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the composition. The colors, the over burned look'' perhaps you weren''t more successful because of the fact that the focal point, the people on the breakwater were not so "defined" or in a "sweeter" position. Thats the luck of the draw, "the photogs curse" as it may be. But, if you photoshop out those people, I would guess youd sell a million prints of this otherwise awesome shot.</td>', 'I love the composition. The colors, the over burned look'' perhaps you weren''t more successful because of the fact that the focal point, the people on the breakwater were not so "defined" or in a "sweeter" position. Thats the luck of the draw, "the photogs curse" as it may be. But, if you photoshop out those people, I would guess youd sell a million prints of this otherwise awesome shot.', '2008-03-01 19:11:11.000000', NULL, 0),
