(4999348, 488819, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love how when I visit this image I find myself stopping at the tree, then quite naturally I want to wander on down the path (your curved leading line).  Once I''ve wandered a bit I discover that I really want to hang out and spend more time at the tree - It''s the only place I can find company in this journey.<br/> <br/>Great job of putting this comp together and utilizing the elements.</td>', 'I love how when I visit this image I find myself stopping at the tree, then quite naturally I want to wander on down the path (your curved leading line).  Once I''ve wandered a bit I discover that I really want to hang out and spend more time at the tree - It''s the only place I can find company in this journey. Great job of putting this comp together and utilizing the elements.', '2008-10-08 12:45:56.000000', NULL, 0),
